      "type": "image",
      "source": "generated",
      "prompt": "Low-poly art: flat-shaded polygon meshes with clean facets and hard edges, simple colour blocking, no visible cubes, no voxels.\nA low-poly game scene based on this game design:\nCover art for the arcade tilt-and-roll game TRICK OR ROLL. A cute golden hamster runs inside a big glass ball, front and centre, rolling down a lantern-lit wooden boardwalk that spirals around a giant glowing jack-o'-lantern in a floating Halloween harvest world: wrapped candies in the air, floating islands with pumpkins, hay bales and windmills, a huge harvest moon, twilight sky. Hand-inked comic-book art in the style of the reference image: bold black ink outlines, halftone dot shading, saturated pumpkin orange, candy pink and violet, warm glowing lantern light. Dynamic low camera, the hamster large and clearly readable, energetic and joyful, spooky-cute not scary. No text, no lettering, no logos, no interface.\n\nDepict the world and atmosphere as a single illustrated scene. Low-poly art with flat-shaded facets and hard edges on every object, no cubes, no voxels, rendered as a highly polished 3D scene with the craft of a Pixar-quality animated film, cinematic lighting that fits the scene, soft ambient occlusion, rich detail and expressive composition. Wordless illustration, no text, no title, no words, no letters, no logos, no UI.",
